# Disney Lorcana Integration Plan

Integrate Disney Lorcana as a third major TCG alongside Pokémon and Magic: The Gathering. This will include a full catalog, real-time-capable data structure, and cart integration.

## Proposed Changes

### Database Layer
Create dedicated tables for Lorcana cards and sets to maintain high performance and data integrity.

#### [NEW] [lorcana_schema.sql](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/db/migrations/lorcana_schema.sql)
- `lorcana_cards`: Stores all card data (name, cost, strength, willpower, rarity, etc.).
- `lorcana_sets`: Stores set definitions (ID, Name, Set Number).

### Infrastructure
Create an automated import tool to populate the local database from the official Lorcana API.

#### [NEW] [Lorcana_Import.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/controllers/Lorcana_Import.php)
- Controller to fetch `https://api.lorcana-api.com/cards/all`.
- Logic to upsert data into `lorcana_cards` and `lorcana_sets`.

#### [NEW] [Lorcana_model.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/models/Lorcana_model.php)
- Methods to retrieve sets, cards by set, and individual card details.
- Stock and pricing management logic.

### Storefront UI
Implement professional set and card views matching the TCGPlayer-style design.

#### [NEW] [view_lorcana_set.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/views/store/view_lorcana_set.php)
- Balanced 3-column grid for Lorcana card listings.
- Proper mapping of Lorcana-specific attributes (Inks, Strength, Willpower).

#### [NEW] [view_lorcana_card.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/views/store/view_lorcana_card.php)
- Detailed card view with Lorcana attributes.
- "Add to Cart" integration.

### Navigation
Update the site-wide navigation to include the new game.

#### [MODIFY] [megamenu.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/views/templates/megamenu.php)
- Add "Disney Lorcana" category with dynamic set listing.

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
1. **Import Test**: Run the import controller and verify the `lorcana_cards` table population.
2. **UI Test**: Navigate to the Lorcana section and verify set/card rendering.
3. **Cart Test**: Verify Lorcana cards can be added to and removed from the cart.

### Manual Verification
- Confirm image rendering from Lorcana-api.com.
- Verify that Lorcana-specific fields (Cost, Inkable) display correctly.
